msgid "系统工具与其他应用"
msgstr "System Tools and Other Applications"

msgid "Fileman 与 Taskmgr"
msgstr "Fileman and Taskmgr"

msgid ""
"Fileman 提供目录浏览、常规文件操作、文件关联和文件名搜索。 左侧设备列表支持可移动卷的发现、授权挂载及安全弹出，操作见 :doc"
":`../admin-guide/usb`。 文件复制与剪切使用 X11 系统剪贴板，可在独立 Fileman 实例间粘贴，历史窗口见 "
":doc:`reliefclipboard`。 当前目录使用 inotify 自动刷新，变动会短暂合并；刷新时保留仍存在的选中项， "
"并尽量保留滚动位置、键盘焦点和正在编辑的地址。监视不递归到子目录； 文件夹树中已展开的当前目录也会同步其直接子目录，其他分支保留原有展开状态。 "
"若监视不可用、权限不足或当前目录被移动、删除，可使用 F5 手动刷新； 状态栏或刷新按钮提示监视不可用。F5 会尝试重新启用监视；监视器可用时， "
"重新导航也会监视新目录。 搜索默认从当前目录递归到子目录，使用相应开关控制范围；结果仍受当前身份权限限制。 Taskmgr "
"按其页面查看任务、资源和系统状态，操作进程前确认目标，不能据显示名称 随意终止用户任务。两者使用 C++/FLTK 和系统中文字体。"
msgstr ""
"Fileman provides directory browsing, ordinary file operations, file "
"associations, and filename search. Its left-hand device list supports "
"removable-volume discovery, authorized mounting, and safe ejection; see "
":doc:`../admin-guide/usb`. File copy/cut uses the X11 system clipboard "
"and supports pasting between independent Fileman instances; for history, "
"see :doc:`reliefclipboard`. The current directory refreshes automatically"
" through inotify, briefly coalescing changes. Refresh retains selections "
"that still exist and tries to preserve scroll position, keyboard focus, "
"and an address being edited. Watching does not recurse into "
"subdirectories. An expanded current directory in the folder tree also "
"synchronizes its immediate subdirectories; other branches retain their "
"expanded state. If watching is unavailable, permissions are insufficient,"
" or the current directory is moved or deleted, use F5 to refresh "
"manually. The status bar or refresh button indicates unavailable "
"watching. F5 attempts to re-enable it; navigating again watches the new "
"directory when monitoring is available. Search recurses from the current "
"directory by default, with scope controlled by the relevant switches; "
"results remain limited by the current user's permissions. Taskmgr's pages"
" show tasks, resources, and system status. Verify targets before process "
"operations; do not terminate user tasks arbitrarily based on display "
"names. Both use C++/FLTK and system Chinese fonts."

msgid "Taskmgr 自启动管理"
msgstr "Taskmgr autostart management"

msgid ""
"“启动应用程序”页合并显示当前用户和系统的 XDG Autostart 项目，列出名称、 状态、来源和命令。点击“添加”创建项目，双击或按 "
"Enter 编辑名称、命令、 描述、工作文件夹、TryExec 条件以及终端选项。命令使用 Desktop Entry 的 Exec "
"语法，含空格的路径使用双引号；可通过浏览按钮选择程序。更改在下次登录时生效， 编辑操作不会立即启动或停止正在运行的程序。"
msgstr ""
"The Startup applications page combines the current user’s and system-wide"
" XDG Autostart entries, showing their names, status, source, and "
"commands. Click Add to create an entry. Double-click an entry or press "
"Enter to edit its name, command, description, working folder, TryExec "
"condition, and terminal option. Commands use Desktop Entry Exec syntax. "
"Enclose paths containing spaces in double quotes, or choose a program "
"with Browse. Changes apply at the next login and control future login "
"launches."

msgid ""
"个人配置位于 ``$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/autostart``，未设置有效绝对路径时使用 "
"``~/.config/autostart``。系统目录依次来自 ``$XDG_CONFIG_DIRS``，默认 ``/etc/xdg``。同名 "
"``.desktop`` 文件按目录优先级覆盖，个人目录优先。 禁用设置 ``Hidden=true``；个人禁用配置同时屏蔽同名系统项目。 "
"系统项目的编辑与禁用写入个人覆盖文件，保留系统原文件。 个人独有项目可删除，存在系统默认值的个人项目显示“恢复默认”；恢复后可能 "
"重新启用系统项目。以 root 运行时可通过用户选择器管理其他普通账户，操作进程 先切换到目标账户身份。其他账户使用其主目录中的默认 XDG "
"配置路径。"
msgstr ""
"Personal configuration is stored in ``$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/autostart``, with "
"``~/.config/autostart`` as the fallback when a valid absolute path is "
"absent. System directories are read in ``$XDG_CONFIG_DIRS`` order, "
"defaulting to ``/etc/xdg``. Files with the same ``.desktop`` filename "
"override lower-priority directories, with the personal directory taking "
"precedence. Disabling sets ``Hidden=true``. A disabled personal entry "
"also masks a system entry with the same filename. Editing or disabling a "
"system entry saves a personal override. Personal-only entries can be "
"removed. A personal entry with a system default offers Restore default, "
"which can enable the system entry again. When run as root, the user "
"selector allows management of other regular accounts. The worker switches"
" to the target account’s identity before operating. Other accounts use "
"the default XDG configuration path under their home directory."

msgid ""
"XDM 的 IceWM 登录会话设置 ``XDG_CURRENT_DESKTOP=ICEWM``，并运行 ``taskmgr --run-"
"autostart``。因此需要安装 Taskmgr 组件。 启动器按 freedesktop Autostart 与 Desktop Entry"
" 规则处理 ``Hidden``、 "
"``OnlyShowIn``、``NotShowIn``、``TryExec``、``Exec``、``Path`` 和 "
"``Terminal``， 使用 GIO 展开字段代码和执行参数。``NoDisplay=true`` 仍可自启动。 终端项目通过会话专用的 "
"GIO 适配脚本调用 st。命令以登录账户身份运行， 继承显示和语言环境；会话结束时清理启动器直接创建的子进程，D-Bus 激活的 已有服务由 "
"D-Bus 管理。每个用户、显示会话有独立锁，避免重复执行启动项。"
msgstr ""
"XDM’s IceWM login session sets ``XDG_CURRENT_DESKTOP=ICEWM`` and runs "
"``taskmgr --run-autostart``, so the Taskmgr component must be installed. "
"The launcher follows the freedesktop Autostart and Desktop Entry rules "
"for ``Hidden``, ``OnlyShowIn``, ``NotShowIn``, ``TryExec``, ``Exec``, "
"``Path``, and ``Terminal``, using GIO to expand field codes and launch "
"arguments. Entries with ``NoDisplay=true`` can still start automatically."
" Terminal entries invoke st through a session-private GIO adapter script."
" Commands run as the logged-in account and inherit its display and "
"language environment. At session end, the launcher cleans up children it "
"created directly. D-Bus manages existing services activated through "
"D-Bus. Each user and display session has its own lock to suppress "
"duplicate startup execution."

msgid ""
"配置扫描与写入由后台进程完成，保存使用临时文件、同步和原子重命名。 修改前检查源文件是否变化。无法解析或缺少程序的项目保留在列表中并标明状态， "
"可刷新后处理。每次最多读取 2048 项，单文件上限 1 MiB，配置原文总量上限 8 MiB，后台传输上限 16 MiB，超限显示错误。旧版 "
"sessiond 的二进制启动数据库 保留原有 API，Taskmgr 的此页面使用 XDG 配置。"
msgstr ""
"Background processes scan and write configuration. Saving uses a "
"temporary file, synchronization, and atomic rename, with a check for "
"source changes before modification. Entries that cannot be parsed or "
"whose programs are unavailable stay visible with their status, allowing "
"inspection after a refresh. Each scan reads up to 2048 entries. "
"Individual files are limited to 1 MiB, original configuration data to 8 "
"MiB in total, and background transfers to 16 MiB. Exceeding a limit "
"produces an error. The legacy sessiond binary startup database supports "
"its original API. This Taskmgr page uses XDG configuration."

msgid ""
"规范见 `Desktop Application Autostart Specification "
"<https://specifications.freedesktop.org/autostart/latest/>`_ 和 `Desktop "
"Entry Specification <https://specifications.freedesktop.org/desktop-"
"entry/latest/>`_。"
msgstr ""
"See the `Desktop Application Autostart Specification "
"<https://specifications.freedesktop.org/autostart/latest/>`_ and the "
"`Desktop Entry Specification <https://specifications.freedesktop.org"
"/desktop-entry/latest/>`_."

msgid "其他程序"
msgstr "Other Programs"

msgid ""
"系统还提供 ReliefAPK、图像查看、绘画、扫雷、系统信息及游戏入口。 组件选择决定它们是否安装，菜单入口不表示程序永远存在。 "
"ReliefOS Browser 应用的系统主页为 ``about:reliefos``；X11 默认浏览器为 NetSurf。 "
"``driverinfo`` 是控制台驱动信息工具，默认显示已激活/Loaded，``-a`` 显示全部状态； "
"以实际设备和驱动状态为准，不把设备枚举等同于成功驱动。 控制台工具与外来软件不需要自研应用桌面图标。"
msgstr ""
"The system also provides ReliefAPK, image viewing, painting, Minesweeper,"
" system information, and game entries. Component selection determines "
"installation; a menu entry does not mean the program is always present. "
"ReliefOS Browser's system home page is ``about:reliefos``; the default "
"X11 browser is NetSurf. ``driverinfo`` is a console driver-information "
"tool, showing active/Loaded status by default and all statuses with "
"``-a``. Rely on actual device and driver state; enumeration alone does "
"not mean a driver is working. Console tools and external software do not "
"require custom application desktop icons."
